1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,465
W: I think I am going to have to take a trip to Chicago tomorrow to talk to Mr. Shaw in person.

2
00:00:05,905 --> 00:00:10,620
I spoke to him on the phone just now, but he didn't sound too convinced about our offer.

3
00:00:10,985 --> 00:00:14,505
M: Well, if that's what's needed, then you'd better get yourself over there.

4
00:00:15,105 --> 00:00:20,740
I don't think I have to stress the fact to you again how important it is that we get this deal.

5
00:00:21,485 --> 00:00:23,885
Please go out of your way to get this contract.

6
00:00:24,405 --> 00:00:27,645
In other words, do what you have to do to get it.

7
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:30,100
W: Yes sir, I will try my best.

8
00:00:30,465 --> 00:00:33,365
By the way, can you tell me where the bus station is?

9
00:00:33,805 --> 00:00:37,905
I have never gone out of the city, and I am not sure where the bus station is.

10
00:00:38,025 --> 00:00:39,375
M: You've got to be kidding me.

11
00:00:39,885 --> 00:00:44,065
Tell you what, I will come and pick you up tomorrow and drive you to the station.

12
00:00:44,625 --> 00:00:47,440
It's the least I can do to get your day started off right.
